      "text": "Every 8 days an Electron rocket rolls off the production line thanks to our mission-obsessed team and advanced factories.\n\nThe Electron team is growing as we prepare to launch more rockets than ever before in 2027.\n\nRole open across vehicle assembly, composites, GNC, propulsion, manufacturing engineering, software, and more. Those with automotive, aerospace, marine, aviation, and manufacturing experience are a great fit. \n\nCome to New Zealand and Long Beach, CA to design, build, test, and launch rockets. Relocation support available.\n\nAdventure awaits: https://rocketlabcorp.com/careers/",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": null,
      "reply_to": "",
